# Keep Docker build context small and stable for layer caching.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/target
**/bin
**/out
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.iml
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.log
**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docs / tests not needed for package -DskipTests image builds
**/*README*
**/*readme*
**/docs
**/*.md

# Local IDE / OS noise
**/.env
**/.env.*
